      "slug": "year-of-roller-coasters-and-unwavering-grind",
      "content": "This year had a lot of roller coaster in store for me, I mean I went from having a girlfriend and being happy with her to breaking up within 2 months, had a internship but had to quit because it was taking a toll on me mentally and several frictions in the workplace, got several interviews and thought this is  the year I was going to breakout in tech but still none, I hope next year becomes better but all I know is that I won't stop grinding until I become filthy rich."
